cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this benchmark, please cite the paper below and the source corpora."
title: "IoMT-SecAlarmBench: A Counterfactual Benchmark for Integrity Attacks in IoMT"
abstract: >-
  A semi-synthetic benchmark that injects controlled integrity attacks into
  genuine coupled ECG+PPG ICU recordings under a factorial design, retaining
  the counterfactual clean signal for every attacked window.
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/techosystem/IoMT-SecAlarmBench"
